447	    /**
448	     * Records the address requirement's offending field name(s) into {@code blankFields}. An owner
449	     * must supply an address in EITHER accepted form: the structured {@code addressLine1} or the flat
450	     * {@code address} (kept for backward compatibility). The requirement is satisfied when at least one
451	     * of those is present and non-blank; only when both are missing or blank is {@code address} reported
452	     * as the offending field. Holding the "an owner must have an address" rule in its own method - rather
453	     * than a bare entry in the field list - gives it one place to live as the accepted address forms grow.
