489	     * validated only when present, so an owner created without one is accepted unchanged. A supplied
490	     * postcode is already constrained to four digits by Bean Validation on {@link OwnerFieldsDto}; this
491	     * additionally rejects a well-formed postcode that is out of range for the city's region using the
492	     * shared {@link Region#acceptsPostcode(int) region-to-postcode} table ({@code NSW 2000-2099},
493	     * {@code VIC 3000-3099}, {@code QLD 4000-4099}). A city with no known region accepts any 4-digit
494	     * postcode. An out-of-range postcode is reported through an {@link InvalidOwnerPostcodeException},
495	     * which the {@code ExceptionControllerAdvice} renders as a 400 response.
