717	     * hard daily create limit ({@link #rejectDailyRegistrationLimit(LocalDate)}) and the soft
718	     * {@code bulkSignupWarning} flag ({@link #bulkSignupWarning(LocalDate)}) so both accumulate a
719	     * day's owners identically.
720	     *
721	     * @param date the registration date to count owners for
722	     * @return the number of existing owners registered on that day
