729	     * The soft daily create threshold above which the read-only {@code bulkSignupWarning} flag is
730	     * raised. Once more than this many owners share a {@code registrationDate}, that day is flagged
731	     * as unusually high volume - a warning well below the hard {@link #MAX_OWNERS_PER_DAY} cap.
732	     */
